## Memory System

Claude uses a file-based memory system to persist context across sessions.

**Memory directory:** `{{COWORK_ROOT}}/memory/`

**How it works:**
- Memory files are plain Markdown files that Claude reads at the start of relevant sessions
- Use `/wrap` at the end of every session to capture learnings and update memory
- The `MEMORY.md` index file lists all available memory files and their purpose
- Add project-specific notes to `MEMORY.md` under `## Active Project Notes`

**Key memory files:**
- `memory/MEMORY.md` — index of all memory files
- `memory/user_profile.md` — your preferences, background, working style
- `memory/feedback_defaults.md` — your default feedback and review preferences

