## Legal & Compliance Rules

- **Review all AI output** before sending to clients — you are responsible for accuracy
- **No PII in prompts** — never paste client personal data, SSNs, financial account numbers, or health information into chat
- **Verify all facts** — Claude can hallucinate; double-check statistics, legal references, and technical claims
- **Client confidentiality** — do not share one client's information when working on another client's project
- **Copyright** — do not reproduce large blocks of copyrighted text verbatim

