## Workflow

### GSD Commands (Get Stuff Done)

Use these slash commands to run structured CoworkOS workflows:

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `/gsd:new-project` | Kick off a new client or internal project |
| `/gsd:plan-phase` | Plan a project phase with tasks and milestones |
| `/gsd:weekly-review` | Run your weekly review and planning session |
| `/gsd:client-checkin` | Prepare for a client check-in meeting |
| `/gsd:retrospective` | Run a project retrospective |

### Superpowers Skills

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `/brainstorm` | Generate ideas on any topic |
| `/wrap` | Wrap up a session and capture learnings |
| `/review` | Review a document, proposal, or piece of work |
| `/draft` | Draft an email, proposal, or document |
| `/research` | Research a topic with structured output |

