## Session Habits

**Start of session:**
1. Tell Claude what you're working on today
2. Reference any relevant memory files or project context

**End of every session:**
1. Run `/wrap` to capture learnings, decisions, and next steps
2. Claude will update the appropriate memory files
3. Note any follow-up items in your task manager

**Weekly:**
- Run `/gsd:weekly-review` to review progress and plan ahead
- Review `memory/MEMORY.md` and prune stale notes

